# Run r1102, SQ-CDJ5 Boot 1 (scratch_queue.md, section SQ-CDJ5 run plan): group A world cdj5 that Boot 0
# (b0_oldworld.qb, SQ-CDJ-11) built with the five displaced standalone jars; now the nested members only.
# Pre-boot setup (displaced jars out, config copies, spawn-animals, probes, region scan "before"): README.txt, Boot 1.
# Order: run plan order, except the rows that need /reload or /dumpall (SQ-CDM-00, SQ-MDP-12, SQ-FGD-03b,
# SQ-DDP-04, SQ-CDJ-09b, SQ-CDM-04, SQ-CDFW-11) are at the end; every kjsexpect/kjsreject row comes before the /reload.
# b1_long.qb (SQ-FGD-07, pigs, about 12 min) runs after this file in the same boot.
#
# Home: the marker tagged cdj5home that Boot 0 left (capture H). Boot 0 blocks, offsets from H (y = H2, the air layer
# above the superflat grass at H2-1): cookie plate (3) +2,0,0; plated hamburger +4,0,0; beef stew +6,0,0; small plate with
# cake slice +8,0,0; Pickling Jar +2,0,3; Cheese Wheel +4,0,3; Veggies / Vintage crops on farmland +6..8,0,3; Fungi colony
# +10,0,3; Copper Pot +2,1,6 on a campfire +2,0,6; Sticky Basket +4,0,6.
# New blocks of this boot sit at z offsets 10..37 (lanes per row) and x offsets 40..60 (loot rolls); FGD-07 uses x -60..-41.
# "Break as a fake player with an empty hand" = `setblock ... air destroy` (Block.dropResources with no tool and no
# entity: the same loot context an empty hand gives; Display's getDrops override runs on that path too).
# Bots (perfBot, survival, invulnerable): one name per row so inventories do not mix.
pace 2

## SQ-CDJ-09 | CD jar nests 20 members; five port items exist
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] members: \[([a-z_]+, ){19}[a-z_]+\]$
bootreject NOT loaded|not from the Creative Delight jar|not nested
shell ! ls mods | grep -i backported
# error count against the last r1101 boot: judged by hand from rows/SQ-CDJ-09.shell.txt
shell echo "error/exception lines in latest.log: $(grep -ciE 'error|exception' logs/latest.log)"
> execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=cdj5home] run say CDJ5 home marker missing
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=cdj5home,limit=1] Pos
capture H entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
reject CDJ5 home marker missing
> difficulty easy
> weather clear 100000
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> pbot spawn cdj {H1} {H2} {H3-3} minecraft:overworld survival
> give cdj veggiesdelight:cauliflower
> give cdj vintagedelight:cheese_slice
> give cdj fungidelight:inky_cap_mushroom
> give cdj miners_delight:cave_carrot
> give cdj displaydelight:abd_duck_noodles
count Gave 1 +\[ >= 5
reject Unknown item|No player was found
look item counts per namespace (displaydelight 212, fungidelight 32, miners_delight 69, veggiesdelight 89, vintagedelight 134 or more) are SQ-CDJ-09b after /dumpall; error count in rows/SQ-CDJ-09.shell.txt against the last r1101 boot

